#Here we provide a demo dataset with 20 human microbiome samples
#
#File description
#seqs.list: Sequence file list for input.
#meta.txt: Meta-data. 
#
#To run the demo, you can either 
#
#sh Readme
#
#or
#type the following commands. 
#
#Commands:
PM-pipeline -i seqs.list -m meta.txt -o out_dir
#
#Output description
#All output results are contained in the output directory "out_dir".
#Check the "out_dir/index.html" for overview of the results.
#
#This demo run should take about 1 hour on a recommended computer.
